/**
 * Upload.jsx — MANUAL CLIENT/VENDOR + TIER AUTO-DETECTION + SCOPED PINCODE SHEET
 *              + DB-PERSISTED PRICING RULES (survives page refresh)
 *
 * PRICING PERSISTENCE:
 * ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
 * • On mount  → loads pricingRules from  GET  /api/pricing
 * • On every add/delete → saves via      PATCH /api/pricing/:scopeKey
 * • The parent's setPricingRules is kept in sync so other components
 *   (e.g. data table) still see the latest rules immediately.
 *
 * PINCODE SHEET SCOPING (unchanged):
 * ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
 * • Super Admin + their internal team  → see the built-in
 *   PINCODE_TIER / DISTRICT_TIER master sheet (read-only).
 * • Company Admin + their team         → Company Pincode Sheet
 *   (admin can upload; team members read-only).
 *   Stored at localStorage key: tenant_<tenantId>_pincodeSheet
 *
 * PROPS:
 *   isSuperAdmin  {bool}  — true for the super admin user
 *   isTeamMember  {bool}  — true for team-member role
 *   (tenantId already existed)
 */

